\item[\ \ translation aspects:]\mbox{} {\em He is important TO me} should be 
treated as a prepobj. {\em He is important FOR x1} should be dealt with 
by means of the optional RC corresponding to the DUTCH rule RADJVOOROBJMOD.
{\em He is important} is an example of a non-modified ADJ (adjp100).
